{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "efe9e4a7-7d8f-834d-b811-75b59fbc8b0c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T13:25:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Siobhan Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:21:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:22:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I want to report a noise problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:22:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can take that. What kind of noise?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:22:09-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Motorcycles."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:22:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it one person, or more than one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:22:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A group. Six, seven of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:22:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And where are they? Are they on the street, in a lot, at a business?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:22:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Outside. Right out front of the building next door. They sit there and rev them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:22:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Can I get the address where it's happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:22:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd rather not give mine. Can you just put the lot next to me? It's off Thames, by the laundromat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:22:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, off Thames by the laundromat. I can note that. When does it happen? What time of day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:22:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Evenings. Every evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:22:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every evening. How long has it been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since the weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So since Saturday, Sunday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sunday. During that storm. The snow turning to rain. They didn't care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, in that weather. And what time do they usually start?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Around six. Go till nine, maybe later. Last night, nine thirty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's three nights now, Sunday, Monday, and then last night, right? Today's Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two. Sunday and Monday. Last night was Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're right, sorry. Sunday and Monday, so two evenings so far. Did you call the police non-emergency line at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:42-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I can still take a report here and send it to the right people. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Siobhan Quinn."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could you spell the last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:58-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Q-U-I-N-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. And a callback number, in case someone needs to follow up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:05-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-two. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:09-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I'm filling in the complaint form while we talk. Hang on a second. [pause] Oh, it's got a typo in the header already. It says 'Complaint Recieved.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ugh. I before E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You caught that fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm a proofreader. It hurts to look at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:32-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll mention it to whoever maintains the form. Okay, so I have a group of six or seven motorcycles, revving outside the building next to the lot off Thames by the laundromat, every evening from about six until nine or later, since Sunday. Anything else I should add?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They're loud enough to rattle the windows."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll put that in. Do you know if it's the same people each night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same jackets. Same bikes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good detail. I'll note it. This will go to the department that handles noise complaints, and they'll decide how to follow up. They may call you at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long will that take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't say exactly. Usually a few business days. If it's happening again tonight, you can also call the police non-emergency line and they can send someone out while it's going on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Tonight, probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably. I'm sorry you're dealing with that, especially after the storm weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just want it to stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Your report is in. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Quinn. Take care."
    }
  ],
